(7488811, 1192178, 68504, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture of the substrata of society.  Congrats on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh Susan, I''m not sure what you mean by "the substrata of society." These people were waiting for ambulatory surgical care - for themselves or for their companions. As was I. It is a vulnerable space. And now I am having compunctions that I took advantage of their good behaviour.</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Great capture of the substrata of society.  Congrats on the ribbon!   Oh Susan, I''m not sure what you mean by "the substrata of society." These people were waiting for ambulatory surgical care - for themselves or for their companions. As was I. It is a vulnerable space. And now I am having compunctions that I took advantage of their good behaviour.', '2016-12-26 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 0),
